    "comparison": "Same instrumented executable. Baseline uses a temporary environment flag to omit prepare_first_frame and retain the original deferred setup. Both modes retain the guarded DXGI fast path. The baseline flag was PHOTOCRAFT_PROFILE_DEFER_FONTS=1; it was absent in fixed runs. This temporary flag is not a production option.",
    "presentation_difference": "Baseline first presents a blank font-setup frame, then the editor. Fixed first presents the editor. Compare first_editor_present_ms for equivalent useful content.",
