      "instructions": "Save the two probe patches from this report into a directory outside the checkout before switching to the archived source. Apply the egui patch inside the pinned egui dependency checkout. Substitute absolute paths, a fresh run directory, an unused localhost port, and a new random control token. Use Windows PowerShell for the environment commands. The recorded executable SHA identifies the measured binary, not a promise of bit-for-bit builds.",
      "source_commands": [
