        "ui.screenshot on run 1 of each mode",
        "app.quit"
      ],
      "timestamp_calculation": "Get process creation with Windows GetProcessTimes. Convert FILETIME ticks to Unix nanoseconds: (ticks - 116444736000000000) * 100. Subtract creation time from each STARTUP_PROFILE SystemTime timestamp. First editor presentation is the first present_N after editor_1.",
